            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>
                    To Quintus Caicilius Cisiacus Septicius Pica Caicilianus, procurator of the Augusti and legate for the provinces of Raetia, Vindelicia and Vallis Poenina, augur, flamen of the divine Augustus and of Roma. Gaius Ligurius Asper, son of Lucius, of the tribe Voltinia, centurion of the 1st cohort of freeborn Roman citizens [set this up].
                </p>
            </div>
